# MASTER CTA

Visual SSOT: `app/spokedu-master/MASTER_VISUAL_SYSTEM.md` § CTA grammar.

Six kinds only: Primary, Secondary, Quiet, Inline, Icon, Sticky mobile.

Tokens:

- Solid Primary = `spm-btn-primary` / `--spm-cta` (not `--spm-acc`, not `bg-slate-950`)
- Selection chips = `spmChipClass` / `spmSegClass` (not Primary)
- Product UI must not use `바로 실행`
- No inset white hairline on Primary

Do not add a seventh CTA kind in this file.
